---
description: UI consistency
globs: src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use design tokens from tailwind config / globals.css (see docs/UI_SPEC.md). No hardcoded hex colours in components.
- Every data view has: loading skeleton, empty state (icon + message + action), error state with retry.
- Every interactive element has hover, focus-visible, disabled states. Min touch target 44px on employee pages.
- Employee pages are mobile-first. Admin pages are desktop-first but must not break at 1024px.
- Use shadcn/ui primitives. Do not hand-roll dialogs, dropdowns, or context menus.
